0 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2015 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공학교육페스티벌 모여라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">어벤져스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">!</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">목적 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">산업성장과 기술혁신을 주도하는 창의적 청년공학인재 양성과 기업경쟁력 제고를 위한 산업계와 공과대학생간 협력의 장 조성</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">산업계 생산</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">기술분야 문제해결을 위한 창의적 아이디어 발굴</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">활용 및 문제해결 역량을 보유한 우수 공학인재 확보 기회 제공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">참여 대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">전국 공과대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">최종선정된 팀의 경우 과제 수행기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">(15</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">~ 16</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">) 6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">개월간 기업과 과제를 수행해야 하기 때문에 군입대 및 졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">취업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">기타사유 등으로 인해 과제수행에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">차질이 발생하지 않을 학생들</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">을 대상으로 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;3</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">. 내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">■&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">문제해결과제를 참여기업이 제시, 팀단위 신청 및 지원과제 선정하여 제작비와 멘토링 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;4</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">프로그램 구성 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">참여기업이 공과대학생을 대상으로 해결과제 제안</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family